Icechunk specification corpus
=============================

Every file in this directory except `PROFILE.md`, `README.md`, `NOTICE` and
`SHA256SUMS` is copied VERBATIM from the `earth-mover/icechunk` repository at
the upstream tag this milestone is anchored to. Nothing in it has been edited,
trimmed, annotated or extended.

    upstream repository   https://github.com/earth-mover/icechunk
    licence               Apache License 2.0 (see LICENSE beside this file)

`icechunk-v0.1.0-alpha.1`, the first checkpoint, predates the repository's
committed `LICENSE` file; the project has been Apache-2.0 from its first public
release, and the licence text shipped here is the one the project committed at
the next checkpoint.

`PROFILE.md` and `README.md` are task-owned: the first records the benchmark's
resolutions where the specification leaves behaviour open, the second is a
navigation index. Neither is part of the upstream specification.

This directory contains documentation only. It contains no implementation.
